00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.000
here we are coming down the stretch and you're

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.200
You've got Terry and Dale, and there you are just waiting and watching.

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:08.980
Well, the biggest deal in that race was there was a couple of things.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:13.080
Our transmission was messed up, and I couldn't get the car in second gear at all, hardly.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.820
And I didn't know how I was going to do it.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:20.360
Finally, like coming down the back straightaway, coming to get the green, I was in third gear.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.520
And I said, man, I'm going to be stuck in the water here.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.070
So I shut the engine off and coasted.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:29.800
And while I had the engine shut off, I was able to jam it into second gear.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.420
And I said, man, that's a relief.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.440
And I let the clutch out, and I'm ready to go.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.040
Then they have a false start.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.040
