00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.880
I'm like, how am I going to do this again?

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:41.560
And somehow got it into second gear.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.040
They throw the green flag.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.820
